# ☁️ AWS Infrastructure using Terraform

This folder contains Terraform code used to provision AWS infrastructure for deploying containerized applications.

---

## Infrastructure Components

- VPC
- Public Subnets
- Internet Gateway
- Route Tables
- Security Groups
- Application Load Balancer
- ECS Cluster
- ECS Service
- Auto Scaling Group

---

## Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|----------|
| provider.tf | AWS Provider |
| subnet.tf | Public Subnets |
| igw.tf | Internet Gateway |
| route.tf | Route Tables |
| security-group.tf | Security Groups |
| alb.tf | Application Load Balancer |
| ecs.tf | ECS Cluster & Service |
| asg.tf | Auto Scaling |
| output.tf | Terraform Outputs |

---

## Initialize Terraform

```bash
terraform init
```

---

## Validate

```bash
terraform validate
```

---

## Plan

```bash
terraform plan
```

---

## Apply

```bash
terraform apply
```

---

## Destroy

```bash
terraform destroy
```

---

## Infrastructure Flow

```
Terraform
     │
     ▼
AWS Provider
     │
     ▼
VPC
     │
     ▼
Subnets
     │
     ▼
Internet Gateway
     │
     ▼
Route Tables
     │
     ▼
Security Groups
     │
     ▼
Application Load Balancer
     │
     ▼
ECS Cluster
     │
     ▼
Auto Scaling
```

---

## Benefits

- Infrastructure as Code
- Reproducible Deployments
- Automated AWS Resource Provisioning
- Version Controlled Infrastructure
- Scalable Architecture
